written; they will have to undergo a second pass rewrite and editing, possibly with some fan input into the development before final release. That means meetings and approvals and bullshit for that. There are also critical writer existence errors to worry about, but hopefully those are few and far between.<br /> <br /> Book available for preview/download in Spring. That'll be after all art comes in and layout is done; a big part of how long that takes is how much art comes in late/needs to be redone and how hard layout turns out to be.<br /> <br /> Physical book may take forever. Right now the turn around time from KS to physical book seems to be a little over a year to a year and a half, with a few badly borked projects.<br /> <br /> Aberrant starts being written early 2017, KS in fall, releases to download Spring 2018. Adventure! follows a similar pattern, and thus we should have something you can play from by 2019, with the physical book being available sometime 2020 to 2021.<br /> <br /> So we've got a wait.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1136-wolfgar","name":"Wolfgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"646"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-29T13:07:56-07:00","id":902960,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wolfgar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/902698-when-tho-before-2018-at-least?p=902956#post902956\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">2018 might be doable, if everything goes well. What I currently expect, based on past experience:<br /> <br /> Kickstarter for Aeon/Trinity Core come Autumn. Right now books are being written; they will have to undergo a second pass rewrite and editing, possibly with some fan input into the development before final release. That means meetings and approvals and bullshit for that. There are also critical writer existence errors to worry about, but hopefully those are few and far between.<br /> <br /> Book available for preview/download in Spring. That'll be after all art comes in and layout is done; a big part of how long that takes is how much art comes in late/needs to be redone and how hard layout turns out to be.<br /> <br /> Physical book may take forever. Right now the turn around time from KS to physical book seems to be a little over a year to a year and a half, with a few badly borked projects.<br /> <br /> Aberrant starts being written early 2017, KS in fall, releases to download Spring 2018. Adventure! follows a similar pattern, and thus we should have something you can play from by 2019, with the physical book being available sometime 2020 to 2021.<br /> <br /> So we've got a wait.</div> </div> </div> </div>Scion's currently pencilled in as the September KS following Gen Con, so the Continuum KS is going to be later.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-29T13:26:15-07:00","id":902972,"title":"","content":"On the plus side: no white wolf approval will be necessary for THESE. AhahahahhahahahahHhahahahahahah","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3487-jetstream","name":"Jetstream","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3487_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"572"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-03T10:07:57-07:00","id":906506,"title":"","content":"as far as PoD. Check Half Priced or any comic / gaming shops. sometimes you can find decent copies that way. There is always Amazon and Ebay though its gets pricey at that point.<br /> <br /> M20 took almost two years from close of KS until a physical book arrived at my doorstep. So yeah, If adventure! is the final book they are working on, even though they aren't doing 20th anniversaries. it'll be 2021 (20 years since original release 2001) before you see a new physical Adventure! book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11622-cynn78","name":"cynn78","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-03T15:42:01-07:00","id":906759,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>cynn78</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/902698-when-tho-before-2018-at-least?p=906506#post906506\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">as far as PoD. Check Half Priced or any comic / gaming shops. sometimes you can find decent copies that way. There is always Amazon and Ebay though its gets pricey at that point.<br /> <br /> M20 took almost two years from close of KS until a physical book arrived at my doorstep. So yeah, If adventure! is the final book they are working on, even though they aren't doing 20th anniversaries. it'll be 2021 (20 years since original release 2001) before you see a new physical Adventure! book.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's all variable. Beast is at the printer right now and it's only been one year. Can't really make predictions like that","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3487-jetstream","name":"Jetstream","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3487_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"572"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}